{"about_the_game":"<ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Choices</strong> have <strong>consequences</strong>!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>2</strong> playable characters</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>6</strong> days</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Diffent endings</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>9 endings</strong> for <strong>Elias</strong>' route</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>3</strong> path dividers affecting the nuances of <strong>Felix' ending</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>SHAME &amp; CHOICES = POSSIBLE APOCALYPSE</strong>\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Prevent this possible \u201capocalypse\u201d from happening by interacting with the mysterious world and its morally grey characters to figure out what\u2019s causing the world to reach a dead end, and find out what choices you need to do and not do to avoid game over.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3767990/extras/7bb5eab7c355a92ef476cad98e7cebbc.avif?t=1773424816\" width=672 height=281 /></span>\u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0 \u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the mind of a daydreamer, you can find:\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2192 <strong>2 playable characters</strong> with such different content that it\u2019s almost like <strong>2 games in 1</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2192 <strong>6 days</strong>, each with different things to explore and experience, and different <strong>consequences</strong> to suffer or enjoy</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2192 several <strong>different</strong> possible <strong>endings</strong>:\u00a0</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <strong>Elias</strong>\u2019 route, there are <strong>9 different endings</strong>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <strong>Felix</strong>\u2019 route, there are <strong>3</strong> <strong>different</strong> path dividers deciding the nuance of <strong>ending</strong> you get.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2192 a <strong>complex story</strong> with many <strong>different possible paths and endings</strong>, more or less <strong>tragic</strong> or <strong>hopeful</strong> depending on how you play it</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2192 a unique game mechanic where <strong>shame</strong> and <strong>mind</strong> affects the gameplay\u00a0\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2192 <strong>dialogue</strong> and <strong>choice</strong> heavy gameplay\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3767990/extras/64a88cf37e71a4a5b0f9ede6c986f810.avif?t=1773424816\" width=1309 height=592 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2192 a great amount of <strong>good writing</strong> - so be prepared to read!\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2192 many different <strong>choices</strong> with many possible <strong>consequences</strong>, where both the \u201c<strong>good</strong>\u201d and \u201c<strong>bad</strong>\u201d options can reward the player with interesting content and useful knowledge (<i>the mind of a daydreamer is a spider web of red threads with endless possible scenarios with hundreds of variables</i>)\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2192 a <strong>colorful</strong> (but not cozy) <strong>hand drawn</strong> environment, taking place in a seemingly normal made-up small <strong>Swedish</strong> town that hides something \u2026 out of this world</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2192 it\u2019s not an erotic game, but it is perverse - but also repressed, both sex positive and sex repulsed, and filled with deep longing and unbearable <strong>shame</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >SOME OF THE CHARACTERS YOU WILL MEET IN THE GAME:\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3767990/extras/ae788597802458ab470bcbdb35c32afe.avif?t=1773424816\" width=128 height=137 /></span><strong>Elias</strong>. He seems warm and kind,\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >but his father says you should fear him. Who can </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >you trust? He seems older than he\u2019s on paper.\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3767990/extras/739a38bc713e8c36c16956df7ff1ccc7.avif?t=1773424816\" width=128 height=137 /></span><strong>Elliott</strong>.\u00a0Elias\u2019 father. He\u2019s crouching, </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >but that doesn\u2019t fool anyone. He\u2019s too tall to walk </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >around in the world as anonymously as he\u2019d want. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >His shame is crippling.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3767990/extras/82bedb3115e15156387213881ffede81.avif?t=1773424816\" width=128 height=137 /></span><strong>Alice</strong>. Elliott\u2019s girlfriend. She </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >looks very young, but don\u2019t worry: Elias checked </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >her ID to calm both his and your paranoia, and </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >she is an adult.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3767990/extras/2a9129d8316a79319b301777c8f83ed6.avif?t=1773424816\" width=128 height=137 /></span><strong>Felix</strong>. His mom (?) calls him </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cain and mocks him. Does he deserve her harsh </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >words and cruel jokes?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3767990/extras/16210299db0888f20bc30ad5aad2611c.avif?t=1773424816\" width=128 height=137 /></span><strong>Levi</strong>. Felix\u2019s parent. As someone </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >from her past wrote: \u201cA hard smile on lips so soft.\u201d</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I think she feels way more than she shows.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3767990/extras/57c3730a2a7210422dc61a3a60b184bd.avif?t=1773424816\" width=128 height=137 /></span><strong>Sebastian</strong>. Levi\u2019s brother, unknown </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >to Felix until recently. Why did Levi never tell Felix about him?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>CHOOSE YOUR VESSEL OF SHAME</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3767990/extras/6e5c23b351bb68f5bef578b2caf66835.avif?t=1773424816\" width=432 height=198 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Which character you choose to play as will greatly affect your experience, and it\u2019s recommended to try to play as both characters to get the fullest picture of their world and understand how and why it can reach a dead end because of your choices or lack thereof, and to figure out how to avoid it happening.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3767990?t=1773424816","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3767990?t=1773424816","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3767990/31cd58519dc67754d372fe3a72e2b50e5a0827af/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1773424816","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3767990/31cd58519dc67754d372fe3a72e2b50e5a0827af/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1773424816","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Keyboard Only Option","id":75},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[1,2,5],"notes":"This is not a pornographic or even erotic game - however, it is a game of shame and contains many shameful things that are \u201dnot safe for work\u201d.\r\n\r\nIt is a perverse game, but also deeply repressed, for hypersexuals and asexuals, sex positive and sex repulsed, for those who have grown up in a household full of shame and those who have grown up in one completely lacking it.\r\n\r\nBut most of all, this game is for adults who have read the coming warnings and accepted them.\r\n\r\nThis game contains disturbing and sensitive themes of sexual and violent nature. There will be depictions of topics such as sexual violence, regular violence, inexplicit implications of sexual acts including minors, heavy intrusive thoughts, descriptions of cannibalism, depression, anxiety, self hate, suicide, trauma, use of alcohol and light drugs, nudity, unhealthy and harmful family relations and dynamics, a lil\u2019 bit of BDSM and a lot of shame. Most of this is depicted through text only, some of it with stylized illustrations."},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":3786770,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Choices</strong> have <strong>consequences</strong>!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>2</strong> playable characters</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>6</strong> days</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Diffent endings</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>9 endings</strong> for <strong>Elias</strong>' route</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>3</strong> path dividers affecting the nuances of <strong>Felix' ending</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>SHAME &amp; CHOICES = POSSIBLE APOCALYPSE</strong>\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Prevent this possible \u201capocalypse\u201d from happening by interacting with the mysterious world and its morally grey characters to figure out what\u2019s causing the world to reach a dead end, and find out what choices you need to do and not do to avoid game over.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3767990/extras/7bb5eab7c355a92ef476cad98e7cebbc.avif?t=1773424816\" width=672 height=281 /></span>\u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0 \u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"